# Per-response elicitation dumps (and their .starts.jsonl sidecars) are
# regenerable from committed code + the release string; they are published to
# results_dist/, not committed here (repo CLAUDE.md section 3). Committed:
# each run's <out>.manifest.json, the screening outputs (small, and the
# provenance the pilots lacked) and the checks outputs in outputs/checks/
# (gate tables and provenance.json: small summary tables, CLAUDE.md section 3).
outputs/elicit/*.jsonl
outputs/elicit/*.lock
# Leftovers of an interrupted atomic manifest write (kmp.elicit.write_manifest).
outputs/elicit/*.manifest.json.*.tmp
__pycache__/
